# The classic play: Bot2 aims Lightning Bolt at Bot1's Cecil, Dark Knight (2/3, legendary). In response Bot1 taps Karakas to
# return Cecil to its owner's hand (it may target its own legendary creature), so the Bolt has no target on resolution and
# is countered (CR 608.2b): Cecil survives, in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Karakas
Mox Jet
Cecil, Dark Knight
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Karakas.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight)
Bot1.Battlefield.Karakas.Activate(Ability: Return; Cecil, Dark Knight)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Karakas; Mox Jet
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
